## Revision 1 finding and rev2 delta

The prior `unbound-byte-aggregate` finding is answered by the orchestrator'"'s explicit stated-bound decision in "'`TASK-260830-2ya5le_rework-rev2.md`. Revision 2 changes only the bound-witness test, two harness test names, and TRACEABILITY wording; production blobs are unchanged. The test now deliberately witnesses admission of different `byte_counts` over identical rows; the matrix and results measure **39 of 40 AC rows driven + 1 stated bound**, with ownership assigned to spec clarification and the §13.14.1 capture-manifest leaf. No row-reconciliation claim remains for bytes. The bound is not treated as a new defect.

